msgid "Leopard1_grinch"
msgstr "Support"

msgid "Leopard1_grinch_descr"
msgstr ""
"The Support is a tactical defender that monitors developments on the "
"battlefield and protects friendly territory by placing defenses. It directly"
" supports and repairs allies in the center and around the base, and prevents"
" Carrier attacks."

msgid "Leopard1_npc_grinch"
msgstr "Guardian tank"

msgid "Leopard1_npc_grinch_descr"
msgstr "Guardian tank"

msgid "Pillbox_grinch"
msgstr "Turret"

msgid "Pillbox_grinch_descr"
msgstr ""
"Turrets autonomously spot and engage enemies. They are most effective at "
"close range and should be placed strategically to be useful but not easily "
"destroyed."

msgid "_105mm_AP_DM13_grinch"
msgstr "Paper Spikes"

msgid "_105mm_AP_DM13_grinch_descr"
msgstr ""
"A fast-firing autocannon with fast HE paper spikes, perfect for tracking "
"Carriers."
